From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:15:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] cheetah: defer Pixel GMS files to Evolution X's
 vendor/gms

Evolution X's vendor/gms installs DeviceIntelligenceNetworkPrebuiltAstrea
(versionCode 137423; CP3A.261005.002.A1's is 136103) and 15 Pixel sysconfig
and default-permission XMLs (byte-identical to ours, google_build.xml and
nowplaying_app_26q1.xml included) as modules; the same names and paths
cannot also come from here. Kati stopped with
"MODULE.TARGET.APPS.DeviceIntelligenceNetworkPrebuiltAstrea already
defined by vendor/google/cheetah". Same as husky's vendor 0001.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Android.bp        | 13 -------------
 cheetah-vendor.mk | 16 ----------------
 2 files changed, 29 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 34cca1d..749f9db 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -315,19 +315,6 @@ android_app_import {
     product_specific: true,
 }
 
-android_app_import {
-    name: "DeviceIntelligenceNetworkPrebuiltAstrea",
-    owner: "google",
-    apk: "proprietary/product/priv-app/DeviceIntelligenceNetworkPrebuiltAstrea/DeviceIntelligenceNetworkPrebuiltAstrea.apk",
-    preprocessed: true,
-    presigned: true,
-    dex_preopt: {
-        enabled: false,
-    },
-    privileged: true,
-    product_specific: true,
-}
-
 android_app_import {
     name: "DevicePersonalizationAiAiPrebuiltPixel2022",
     owner: "google",
